1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,840
So now I wanted to show you guys what a dinner out here in switzerland can cost you.
现在我想给你们看看，在瑞士出去吃一顿晚餐可能要花多少钱。

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:10,720
So we came here tonight to the top of the met which haven't tried the food yet but these views are just miraculous.
今晚我们来了一个字幕称为 top of the met 的地方，还没尝食物，但这景色简直不可思议。

3
00:00:11,359 --> 00:00:21,000
This whole entire country just looks like one giant amusement park we have the church bells going right now there's trains going around everything is just picture perfect.
这整个国家看起来就像一个巨大的游乐园。现在教堂钟声响着，火车穿行，一切都美得像画一样。

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,240
But now we're going to see what we get here for dinner hay made us get the cheese fond de so hopefully this is going to be worth it.
接下来看看晚餐会有什么。她让我们点了奶酪火锅，希望会物有所值。

5
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:39,100
I think it's like 65 bucks so better be good or I'm coming for you hy.
我想大概六十五美元，所以最好好吃，否则我可要找你算账。

6
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:49,829
So cheese fondue for the first time ever having it that was pretty darn delicious.
这是第一次吃奶酪火锅，刚才那口真的相当美味。

7
00:00:49,839 --> 00:00:56,790
Haly with food you never steer me wrong I don't but with my wallet sometimes yes.
说到吃，你从不会带我踩雷。我不会，但说到钱包，有时就会。

8
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:04,640
So the total meal for the two of us with just getting one cheese fondue and a couple glasses of wine came out to around 120 usd.
我们两个人只点了一份奶酪火锅和几杯葡萄酒，整顿饭总共大约一百二十美元。

9
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:11,269
But surprisingly wine as I guess in Europe is a lot cheaper than in america was only about 5 a glass.
不过让我意外的是，按我的印象，欧洲的葡萄酒比美国便宜不少，这次每杯只要大约五美元。

10
00:01:11,279 --> 00:01:21,520
So it's just that cheese fondue that uh really did us dirty like that I still say totally worth it though it was something to it was an experience.
所以真正让我们钱包吃不消的是奶酪火锅。我还是觉得值得，虽然说到一半停了一下，但这算是一种体验。

11
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:32,030
And it was delicious it was like it really was it really was good call you're welcome.
而且很好吃。真的，真的很好吃。选得好。不客气。

12
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:41,750
After looking up why switzerland is so expensive I learned how the average salary in the country is nearly 125 000.
查了瑞士为什么这么贵以后，我了解到一个说法：这里的平均工资接近十二万五千。

13
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:46,560
With also having the highest minimum wage of 25 per hour.
他还说这里有最高的最低工资，每小时二十五。

14
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:53,719
On top of all this anything from switzerland you can guarantee it will be top of the line quality whether it's food.
除此之外，作者认为，瑞士的东西都能保证是顶级品质，比如食物……

15
00:01:53,719 --> 00:02:00,719
Or watches or trains the swiss are magicians when it comes to engineering.
或是手表、火车；在工程方面，作者觉得瑞士人像魔术师一样厉害。

16
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:11,320
Good morgan from grindlewald switzerland today we have another very exciting actionpack day where we are taking the trim back up to a different different mountain.
字幕用 good morgan 向大家问早，地点是格林德瓦。今天又是活动满满的一天，我们坐字幕写作 trim 的交通工具去另一座山。

17
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:19,000
And then going to be trotty biking down it's kind of like these crazy little tricycles that we're literally going to be taking down the mountain.
然后骑字幕称为 trotty 的车下山，看起来像疯狂的小三轮车，我们真的要骑着它们下山。

18
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:22,880
I don't know how but we're going to figure it out soon.
我不知道要怎么弄，不过很快就会搞明白。

19
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:32,599
Now to get down the mountain there are three stages with the first being flying so now for the first part of the way down.
下山分三个阶段，第一个阶段是飞。所以，下山的第一段……

20
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:48,760
We're going to be flying this is insane are you nervous yeah can't see anything oh my god.
我们要飞下去。这也太疯狂了。你紧张吗？对，什么也看不见。天哪。

21
00:02:48,760 --> 00:03:04,240
Just want to stay until the morning sun lay here forever you and together I just want to stay until the morning's done I just want.
背景歌声大意是：想一直待到早晨，永远躺在这里，你和……然后又唱想待到早晨结束，接着重复想要……

22
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:24,320
To stay until the morning I just want to stay until the morning my first day on earth you sang me a tune.
歌声继续重复待到早晨，又提到来到世上的第一天，有人为我唱了一支曲子。

23
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:32,399
Guys the swiss do not mess around I thought it was going to be kind of this rinky dink little bike that you wouldn't be able to go too fast on.
各位，瑞士人真不含糊。我原以为那会是辆简陋的小车，根本骑不快。

24
00:03:32,399 --> 00:03:37,829
But boy was I wrong we were flying down the mountain.
结果我可想错了，我们一路像飞一样冲下山。

25
00:03:37,839 --> 00:03:45,680
It is so hard to break you're going so fast also you're going through these clouds where you can possibly fall off the side of the mountain.
车速太快，很难刹住，还要穿过云层，感觉有可能从山边掉下去。

26
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:59,360
Luckily both of us are still alive and now celebrating with some swiss beer some traditional swiss mixed with spray which I've never heard before.
幸好我们两个还活着，现在用瑞士啤酒庆祝，传统瑞士啤酒里混入字幕写作 spray 的饮料，我以前从没听过。

27
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:06,480
I've never heard of this either but hay's not a big beer drinker so they recommended her to get a beer mixed with sprit.
我也没听过。她不太喝啤酒，所以别人推荐给她一杯混了字幕所写 sprit 的啤酒。

28
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:14,040
Never heard of it it's not bad not bad I mean you really have a sweet tooth so I feel like this is perfect for you.
从没听过。还不错，还不错。你确实爱吃甜的，所以我觉得很适合你。

29
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:24,640
I can't tell if it's spray or beers tastes like both in one in one drink.
我分不清是字幕所写的 spray 还是啤酒，喝起来像两者合在一起，同一杯里。

30
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:39,040
Whoa this this right over here wow that's actually really good I thought it would taste funky but not a bad combination.
哇，这个，这边这个，真的挺好喝。我以为味道会很怪，但搭在一起还不错。
